WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,520
The gate, fence and monitoring bracket are all connected into one body.

2
00:00:02,920 --> 00:00:04,080
I want to break through from the front again

3
00:00:04,280 --> 00:00:06,000
At least the entire metal shell must be penetrated first

4
00:00:06,440 --> 00:00:19,400
People with ordinary powers will not be accepted here.

5
00:00:19,600 --> 00:00:20,800
Enable divisions to fight in port

6
00:00:21,080 --> 00:00:22,400
Can you build this kind of wall overnight?

7
00:00:22,400 --> 00:00:24,120
Is this a new distribution of the superpower base?

8
00:00:40,020 --> 00:00:41,020
Not an official project

9
00:00:42,270 --> 00:00:43,230
Could it be that person?
